ensity 0.2 above D-min, Status M; y is log sensitivity (reciprocal exposure in ergs/cm2) as printed, the axis runs 0.0 to 4.0. The exposure light is not stated on the plot.","Spectral-dye-density plot has only 'Midscale Neutral' (mid) and 'Minimum Density' (min), both drawn solid, no separate c/m/y dyes; y axis runs 0.0 to 2.5.","Grain: Print Grain Index for 135 at 4x6 print (33); 8x10 = 55, 16x20 = 84. Grey card (grey side) red density 0.74 to 0.94 (page 2). Printing: optimized for Kodak Professional Portra Endura, Supra Endura and Ultra Endura papers."],"print":"kodak-endura-premier","grain":{"grain":13.5,"grain_size":20.0,"grain_roughness":50.0}}